						 <p>Oh dear god <em>yes.</em> Tiny omnicidal reptile!</p> <p>Other possibilities: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-701">701-1</a><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-383869-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-999">999</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1470">1470</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1370">1370</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1867">1867</a><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-383869-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1060">1060</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1027">1027</a>, Agent Lombardi (&#8230;maybe), Dr. Sorts, Dr. Vang, Dr. Bridge, Dr. Djoric&#8230;</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-383869-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. No, I don't want to know how they got 5555-J up to it.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-383869-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Because I <em>know</em> it'll be demanded, not because I think it needs doing.</div> </div> 
